---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Chinese-Zodiac-Calculator.com"
  description="Read the Chinese-Zodiac-Calculator.com privacy policy to understand how we collect and protect your data when using our Chinese zodiac calculator and related website tools."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Home", href: "/" }, { label: "Privacy", href: "/privacy-policy" }]}
>
  <section class="relative mx-auto max-w-[800px] px-4 py-12 lg:px-6 lg:py-16">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-zodiac-gold/70 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <header class="mb-8 text-center">
      <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <span class="h-px w-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-zodiac-gold/70"></span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-[5px] bg-zodiac-red px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-white shadow-md shadow-red-900/20" style="font-family: var(--font-cn)">隐私</span>
        <span class="hidden text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-zodiac-gold sm:inline">Yǐnsī</span>
        <span class="h-px w-10 bg-gradient-to-l from-transparent to-zodiac-gold/70"></span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zodiac-ink dark:text-stone-100 sm:text-4xl">Privacy <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-zodiac-deep via-zodiac-red to-zodiac-bronze bg-clip-text pb-1 text-transparent">Policy</span></h1>
    </header>
    <p class="mb-8 text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Last updated: August 21, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-stone max-w-none dark:prose-invert space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>Chinese-Zodiac-Calculator.com does not require an account or registration. When you use our zodiac calculator or browse our pages:</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Birth date</strong> — Only the date you enter into the calculator; this is processed client-side in your browser and is not transmitted to or stored on our servers.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">No analytics or tracking</strong> — We do not run analytics scripts, tracking pixels, or advertising cookies. Your browsing activity is not collected.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>Zodiac calculations happen entirely in your browser — no birth date data reaches our servers. The only information we may receive is a message you choose to send via the contact page, which we use solely to respond to you. We do not sell, rent, or share personal information with third parties for their marketing purposes.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">3. Data Storage &amp; Security</h2>
        <p>All zodiac calculations are performed in your browser. No birth date information is transmitted to or stored on our servers. Our site uses HTTPS encryption for all data in transit. We implement industry-standard security measures to protect any information we do collect.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>The site is served through Cloudflare (CDN and security) and a hosting provider (e.g., Vercel or Netlify). Fonts are self-hosted on our own domain. We do not use advertising networks or third-party analytics services.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to: request access to personal data we hold about you, request deletion of your data, and withdraw any consent you have given. To exercise these rights, contact us via the contact page.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">6. Cookies</h2>
        <p>We do not use cookies. No cookies are set by this website, and none are used for advertising or cross-site tracking. If we ever introduce cookies or analytics in the future, this policy will be updated before they are added.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">8. Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy or how your data is handled, please reach out through our <a href="/contact" class="text-zodiac-red hover:underline">contact page</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
